EU foreign ministers are gathered in Luxembourg for an urgent meeting 🇪🇺. They’re working to strengthen migration control deals with North African nations, specifically looking at financial incentives and joint operations. The goal is to reduce irregular migration across the Mediterranean, especially from Tunisia and Libya. Some ministers have expressed doubts about whether commitments from partner countries will be fully upheld 🧐.
#MigrationEU #Luxembourg
